                DELETE FROM parsed_tracks
                WHERE ttl_expires_at IS NOT NULL
                AND ttl_expires_at <= CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
        Clear all cache entries
        Returns:
            True if successful
Get or create global cache instance"""
